<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Colonial launches low home loan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Colonial launches low home loan.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The unlised Colonial State Bank, one of the leaders in the recent round of mortage rate cuts, said on Sunday it would offer a one-year rate of 6.49 percent, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Colonial said its Sweetheart Flexi-Fixed home loan was available to new customers or new borrowings.</p>
<p>Colonial and the Commonwealth Bank of Australia last Wednesday reduced their standard variable mortgage rates by 70 basis points to 7.55 percent, a level later matched by another bank major National Australia Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
